false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-06-06T23:29:02Z","updated_at":"2025-06-12T10:00:09Z","closed_at":"2025-06-12T10:00:08Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in custom 4.5 build from commit bd94fc7\n- Not reproducible in custom 4.5 build from commit 51b1775\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.custom1.mono (26df04377) - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7283) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800X 8-Core Processor (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nResources that inherit from a global script class are not saved properly anymore. This affects both GDScript and C#. Non-global scripts are NOT affected.\n\nAffected resources show none of the custom properties in the inspector and can no longer be accessed from other scripts:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/530018b2-1261-4eda-9a64-b35e4149082a)\n\n\n---\n\nFrom what I can tell. the issue is that the `script` property is now skipped when saving global resources, because the code thinks it matches the default value.\n\nIn the code that checks whether a property has the same value as its default value, the new function (`PropertyUtils::get_property_default_value`) that is used to fetch that default value no longer returns null for the `script` property if that script is a global class. This causes the equals check to pass and so the `script` property is skipped for saving.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/42c7f144225fa3992ceda284ad8f8edcbd1e7455/scene/resources/resource_format_text.cpp#L1934-L1939\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a global class that inherits from resource with either GDScript or C# (or use the MRP which has scripts for each)\n2. Create an asset with this new class you created\n3. Save the asset\n4. Restart the godot editor\n5. Observe that when you inspect the resource, none of its properties are displayed anymore\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bug-csharp-resources.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20635432/bug-csharp-resources.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107243/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":5},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107243/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}